  {:id "budgets:423" :draft "budgets" :line 423 :level :may :section "authorization-endpoint" :text "How an agent knows an operation is metered before its first call is answered by R3 ([@?I-D.hardt-aauth-r3]): a resource MAY annotate individual operations in its vocabulary with a budget annotation, and an agent that reads one knows to include `budget` in this request." :suite-clauses [] :scenarios []}
